---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="What Orpheon is, and how the journal is written.">
  <article class="max-w-xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight">About</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-journal mt-8">
      <p>
        {site.title} is a record of work by {site.ownerName}. Each project is a single page: problem, summary, architecture, results, and examples.
      </p>
      <h2>When it runs</h2>
      <p>
        It does not run overnight. It does not run when a tracked repository changes. It runs when you trigger the <strong>Update journal</strong> GitHub Action.
      </p>
      <p>
        That Action still compares each repository’s HEAD to the last processed SHA. Unchanged repos are skipped. Changed repos are read as one accumulated diff, classified, and documented. Failed repos keep their previous SHA.
      </p>
      <h2>What it will not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Invent papers, APIs, metrics, or users</li>
        <li>Publish secrets or private URLs</li>
        <li>Override human <code>.orpheon.yml</code></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
